<refnamediv>
  <refname><type>SilikoToken</type></refname>
  <refpurpose>Type representing a lexical token</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">typedef /* ... */ SilikoToken;</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <type>SilikoToken</type> represents a token yielded by a
lexical analyser. it can represent an integer value, a real number,
a single-character token, a function identifier, the end of an input,
or nothing as a default value.</para>
</refsection>
